# Fallback for any build from the repo root whose Dockerfile has no <Dockerfile>.dockerignore of its
# own beside it. It only keeps secrets and host state out; each Dockerfile allow-lists what it needs.
.git
config/
**/private
**/*.private.*
**/*.local.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
HANDOFF.md
.integrity/transcripts/
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/gen
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
